1103
01:02:38,500 --> 01:02:38,600
Huh?

1104
01:02:48,320 --> 01:03:05,760
Kokoro, why didn't you show up?

1105
01:03:05,960 --> 01:03:06,520
I did.

1106
01:03:06,840 --> 01:03:08,600
I was the only one who did show up.

1107
