1121
01:03:31,240 --> 01:03:34,140
I checked in on the class that Masamune is supposed to be in.

1122
01:03:35,140 --> 01:03:39,000
Except they told me that there was nobody there with that name.

1123
01:03:39,000 --> 01:03:41,580
Um, Masamune's not here yet?

1124
01:03:42,440 --> 01:03:44,460
We waited for Masamune to arrive.

1125
01:03:45,060 --> 01:03:46,220
We waited the next day.

1126
01:03:46,280 --> 01:03:47,480
And the day after.

1127
01:03:48,020 --> 01:03:48,820
But he didn't come.

1128
01:03:50,400 --> 01:03:54,660
And just as we thought he'd never come back, he finally showed up.

1129
01:03:55,740 --> 01:03:57,400
There's only one explanation.

1130
01:03:58,100 --> 01:04:01,420
Each of us is an inhabitant of a different parallel world.

1131
01:04:01,420 --> 01:04:05,180
A different parallel world?

1132
01:04:05,380 --> 01:04:07,960
Like, the ones that pop up a lot in science fiction?

1133
