Since they all grow from the same trunk, they're a lot alike, but slightly different ultimately.

1155
01:04:54,760 --> 01:04:59,140
Which is why Subaru's not in my world.

1156
01:04:59,200 --> 01:05:03,640
Or why Kokoro and Fuko or Enaki's.

1157
01:05:03,640 --> 01:05:05,480
Gate World. You've never heard of it?

1158
01:05:06,360 --> 01:05:07,940
Professor Nagahisa's new game.

1159
01:05:08,120 --> 01:05:09,100
It's selling like crazy.

1160
01:05:10,100 --> 01:05:11,600
I have a friend who knows him.

1161
