1181
01:05:53,200 --> 01:05:56,020
All this time, and the only thing you could come up with

1182
01:05:56,020 --> 01:05:57,940
is some half-baked video game premise.

1183
01:05:58,680 --> 01:06:00,080
You should hit the reset button.

1184
01:06:00,080 --> 01:06:04,100
But then, how come our realities are slightly different from each other?

1185
01:06:04,420 --> 01:06:06,160
And we can't meet up in the outside world.

1186
01:06:06,860 --> 01:06:09,060
So, parallel worlds is the only answer, right?

1187
