Think!

1193
01:06:18,140 --> 01:06:21,340
I gave you a hint at the start of all this.

1194
01:06:22,660 --> 01:06:25,520
I also left you more than enough clues about the key.

1195
01:06:26,880 --> 01:06:27,680
About the key?

1196
01:06:27,680 --> 01:06:31,520
Actually, I found something under my bed.

1197
01:06:31,940 --> 01:06:33,440
It's some sort of cross symbol.

1198
01:06:34,120 --> 01:06:34,900
What does it mean?

1199
01:06:36,140 --> 01:06:38,340
There's something like that under my desk, too.

1200
01:06:38,940 --> 01:06:40,760
I just thought it was some sort of emblem.

1201
01:06:42,140 --> 01:06:43,300
There's one in the bath.

1202
01:06:43,960 --> 01:06:45,940
It stuck out since there's no running water.

1203
01:06:46,360 --> 01:06:48,120
I checked and saw it there.

1204
01:06:49,120 --> 01:06:50,980
I saw one in the oven the other day.

1205
01:06:52,060 --> 01:06:54,520
There's another one in the dining room cabinet, as well.

1206
01:06:56,260 --> 01:06:56,980
You're right.

1207
01:06:57,560 --> 01:06:58,480
I saw one.

1208
01:06:58,700 --> 01:07:00,320
It's inside the closet in my room.

1209
01:07:02,960 --> 01:07:03,980
Sick so far.

1210
01:07:05,280 --> 01:07:07,060
But there could be even more of them.

1211
01:07:08,060 --> 01:07:09,280
Are these also hints?

1212
01:07:10,460 --> 01:07:11,420
Think about it.

1213
01:07:11,420 --> 01:07:16,320
This castle and its mysteries are all part of the mission you've been given.

1214
01:07:17,240 --> 01:07:19,880
Forget finding the key and stay until the end.

1215
01:07:24,140 --> 01:07:25,560
Or find the key.

1216
01:07:28,480 --> 01:07:29,980
And grant your wish.

1217
01:07:32,000 --> 01:07:33,200
You're free to choose.

1218
01:07:41,520 --> 01:07:41,840
You're fine.

1219
01:07:49,780 --> 01:07:50,120
You're free to choose.

1220
01:07:50,120 --> 01:08:19,680
Still no sign of it, the key.

1221
01:08:20,120 --> 01:08:23,120
And we're quickly running out of time.

1222
01:08:25,120 --> 01:08:28,120
Looks like I can only play video games here for another two weeks.

1223
01:08:28,120 --> 01:08:34,120
You know, if it wasn't for you showing me, I never would have realized how cool video games can be.

1224
01:08:34,120 --> 01:08:38,120
I'm amazed at how advanced they are now. It's crazy.

1225
01:08:38,120 --> 01:08:43,120
You finish them faster than me. RPGs, fighting games, it doesn't matter.

1226
01:08:43,120 --> 01:08:45,120
That's just not fair at all.

1227
01:08:45,120 --> 01:08:52,120
Well, it really made me interested in computers. I want to study them properly. So I decided to go back.

1228
01:08:52,120 --> 01:09:01,120
About a month ago, I took an entrance exam. I wanted to get into a part-time tech school and I got accepted.

1229
01:09:01,120 --> 01:09:04,120
You studied to get into a tech school?

1230
01:09:04,120 --> 01:09:06,120
Yeah, more or less.

1231
01:09:06,120 --> 01:09:08,120
I had no idea.

1232
01:09:08,120 --> 01:09:10,120
Looks like I'll be switching schools.

1233
01:09:10,120 --> 01:09:12,120
Whoa, really?

1234
01:09:12,120 --> 01:09:19,120
My dad was able to find me a pretty decent private school. I took the entrance exam. Got in yesterday.

1235
01:09:19,120 --> 01:09:21,120
Good for you.

1236
01:09:21,120 --> 01:09:23,120
Actually, I'll probably transfer schools too.

1237
01:09:23,120 --> 01:09:29,120
While my dad is to stay in Japan for work, he and mom talked. And we'll be looking at schools overseas.

1238
01:09:29,120 --> 01:09:32,120
You're studying abroad. That's amazing.

1239
01:09:32,120 --> 01:09:42,120
I'm torn. I still don't know what I'm going to do. My parents are telling me I should transfer too. But I just can't decide.

1240
01:09:42,120 --> 01:09:45,120
Fuuka's been playing the piano a lot more often lately.

1241
01:09:45,120 --> 01:09:49,120
I know. She mentioned to me that she's enjoying it a lot more too.

1242
01:09:49,120 --> 01:09:52,120
I wonder if she's gonna stick with it and keep playing piano.

1243
01:09:52,120 --> 01:09:55,120
Who knows? Maybe she will.

1244
01:09:55,120 --> 01:09:58,120
As for me, I'll repeat.

1245
01:09:58,120 --> 01:09:59,120
Hmm?

1246
01:09:59,120 --> 01:10:03,120
Everybody says that I should do the year all over again.

1247
01:10:03,120 --> 01:10:06,120
I didn't do any studying. No surprise there.

1248
01:10:18,120 --> 01:10:20,120
So sorry I got here late.

1249
01:10:20,120 --> 01:10:22,120
Oh, it's alright.

1250
01:10:22,120 --> 01:10:25,120
Kokoda wanted to get a burger. So we came early.

1251
01:10:25,120 --> 01:10:28,120
How are you? Is this okay?

1252
01:10:31,120 --> 01:10:35,120
I thought meeting somewhere more lively might be a nice change of pace.

1253
01:10:35,120 --> 01:10:37,120
Tell me if it's too much.

1254
01:10:37,120 --> 01:10:43,120
As for your future school plans, I've already met with your mom a couple of times.

1255
01:10:43,120 --> 01:10:45,120
I also had a chance to speak with your dad.

1256
01:10:45,120 --> 01:10:47,120
You talked with my dad?

1257
01:10:47,120 --> 01:10:48,120
Mm-hmm.

1258
01:10:48,120 --> 01:10:53,120
We wanted to discuss your options and to figure out what would be the best path for you.

1259
01:10:53,120 --> 01:10:54,120
Mm-hmm.

1260
01:10:54,120 --> 01:10:59,120
You could switch to another school. It would be in an adjacent district nearby.

1261
01:10:59,120 --> 01:11:04,120
Or you could stay at Yukishina and then switch into a different class than Sanada.

1262
01:11:04,120 --> 01:11:05,120
I could do that?

1263
01:11:05,120 --> 01:11:06,120
Yes.

1264
01:11:06,120 --> 01:11:11,120
I've spoken to all of the school administrators and they've all said they've made it their top priority.

1265
01:11:11,120 --> 01:11:14,120
And will they also be doing something about Sanada's friends?

1266
01:11:14,120 --> 01:11:18,120
Ah. You're referring to Toyosaka and Maeda from your class, correct?

1267
01:11:18,120 --> 01:11:20,120
Oh, along with Nakayama, of course.

1268
01:11:20,120 --> 01:11:22,120
They'll all be switching classes as well.

1269
01:11:22,120 --> 01:11:23,120
Mm-hmm.

1270
01:11:23,120 --> 01:11:27,120
Oh, and we'll also be getting you a new homeroom teacher if we can.

1271
01:11:27,120 --> 01:11:31,120
And, um, what about Moe Tojo?

1272
01:11:31,120 --> 01:11:34,120
Miss Tojo will be transferring schools again.

1273
01:11:34,120 --> 01:11:35,120
What?

1274
01:11:35,120 --> 01:11:38,120
You know that her dad's a college professor, right?

1275
01:11:38,120 --> 01:11:41,120
I heard that he'll be teaching at a college in Nagoya starting in April.

1276
01:11:41,120 --> 01:11:44,120
Mm-hmm.

1277
01:11:44,120 --> 01:11:48,120
We can visit schools in the neighboring districts.

1278
01:11:48,120 --> 01:11:49,120
Mm.

1279
01:11:49,120 --> 01:11:54,120
Although, if you don't want to, there's no need to go back to junior high.

1280
01:11:54,120 --> 01:11:55,120
Huh?

1281
01:11:55,120 --> 01:12:01,120
Your mom and I are both of the opinion that school isn't necessarily the answer, and you don't have to go.

1282
01:12:01,120 --> 01:12:05,120
You could just attend the classroom of the heart. Or other options.

1283
01:12:05,120 --> 01:12:06,120
Hm.

1284
01:12:06,120 --> 01:12:07,120
Hm.

1285
01:12:09,120 --> 01:12:11,120
You are not alone.

1286
01:12:11,120 --> 01:12:14,120
We'll work together to figure out what's best for you.

1287
01:12:14,120 --> 01:12:15,120
Okay.

1288
01:12:28,120 --> 01:12:29,120
So cute.

1289
01:12:29,120 --> 01:12:30,120
Want one?

1290
01:12:30,120 --> 01:12:31,120
Yeah.

1291
01:12:31,120 --> 01:12:34,120
Hey, let's go to the convenience store.

1292
01:12:34,120 --> 01:12:36,120
I want to buy snacks.

1293
01:12:36,120 --> 01:12:37,120
Of course.

1294
01:12:40,120 --> 01:12:42,120
Tomorrow will be our last day.

1295
01:12:42,120 --> 01:12:44,120
I'm all prepped for the farewell party.

1296
01:12:47,120 --> 01:12:49,120
This is what I think.

1297
01:12:49,120 --> 01:12:52,120
There have been others who couldn't go to school like me.

1298
01:12:52,120 --> 01:12:57,120
And just like me, they met the Wolf Queen and spent time at the castle.

1299
01:12:57,120 --> 01:13:05,120
No one ever finds out about it because, when their wishes are granted, all their memories of that place fade away.

1300
01:13:05,120 --> 01:13:11,120
Whether my wish gets granted or not, I'm grateful the castle in the mirror exists.

1301
01:13:11,120 --> 01:13:14,120
Truly grateful.

1302
01:13:14,120 --> 01:13:16,120
Can I come in and clean?

1303
01:13:16,120 --> 01:13:17,120
But Mom, what about work?

1304
01:13:17,120 --> 01:13:18,120
Someone's coming by.

1305
01:13:18,120 --> 01:13:19,120
They'll be cleaning our AC system.

1306
01:13:19,120 --> 01:13:20,120
I figured I'd pop into work later in the afternoon.

1307
01:13:20,120 --> 01:13:21,120
Can I come in?

1308
01:13:21,120 --> 01:13:22,120
Let me do it.

1309
01:13:22,120 --> 01:13:23,120
I'm sorry.

1310
01:13:23,120 --> 01:13:24,120
I'm sorry.

1311
01:13:24,120 --> 01:13:25,120
They'll be cleaning our AC system.

1312
01:13:25,120 --> 01:13:27,120
I figured I'd pop into work later in the afternoon.

1313
01:13:27,120 --> 01:13:28,120
Can I come in?

1314
01:13:28,120 --> 01:13:30,120
Let me do it.

1315
01:13:30,120 --> 01:13:31,120
Let me do it.

1316
01:14:00,120 --> 01:14:01,120
Let me do it.

1317
01:14:17,120 --> 01:14:19,120
Do you want to come over?

1318
01:14:22,120 --> 01:14:24,120
Good thing I bought two of these.

1319
01:14:28,120 --> 01:14:29,120
Which would you like?

1320
01:14:30,120 --> 01:14:32,120
Um, let's see.

1321
01:14:32,120 --> 01:14:33,120
Let's see.

1322
01:14:33,120 --> 01:14:34,120
This one.

1323
01:14:43,120 --> 01:14:47,120
I, uh, wanted to thank you for writing that letter.

1324
01:14:47,120 --> 01:14:49,120
By the way, is it true?

1325
01:14:49,120 --> 01:14:51,120
You're transferring schools?

1326
01:14:51,120 --> 01:14:52,120
Hmm.

1327
01:14:52,120 --> 01:14:53,120
I'm sorry.

1328
01:14:56,120 --> 01:14:57,120
Don't be.

1329
01:15:00,120 --> 01:15:03,120
When I saw you that day, at school by the cubbies.

1330
01:15:03,120 --> 01:15:06,120
I wanted to say something, but then couldn't.

1331
01:15:06,120 --> 01:15:09,120
Things were still awkward for me.

1332
01:15:09,120 --> 01:15:10,120
Awkward?

1333
01:15:10,120 --> 01:15:13,120
Recently, Sonata's group had turned on me.

1334
01:15:13,120 --> 01:15:19,120
That's why, if they had found out I talked to you, they might have done something to you, too.

1335
01:15:19,120 --> 01:15:21,120
But, what happened?

1336
01:15:21,120 --> 01:15:23,120
I'm not completely sure.

1337
01:15:23,120 --> 01:15:28,120
For some reason, they all thought I looked down on them, and they really didn't like that.

1338
01:15:29,120 --> 01:15:30,120
Huh.

1339
01:15:31,120 --> 01:15:37,120
They said I tried to steal Nakayama's boyfriend, that I'm a guy stealer, and also a homewrecker.

1340
01:15:37,120 --> 01:15:39,120
I had enough.

1341
01:15:39,120 --> 01:15:41,120
I did look down on them all.

1342
01:15:41,120 --> 01:15:42,120
Huh.

1343
01:15:42,120 --> 01:15:43,120
They're so shallow.

1344
01:15:43,120 --> 01:15:47,120
All they care about, all they ever talk about is boy stuff.

1345
01:15:48,120 --> 01:15:51,120
None of them care about school, and they're all immature.

1346
01:15:51,120 --> 01:15:53,120
They'll be the same in 10-20 years.

1347
01:15:54,120 --> 01:15:56,120
Still living their shallow lives.

1348
01:15:57,120 --> 01:15:58,120
Whoa, Molly.

1349
01:15:58,120 --> 01:15:59,120
What?

1350
01:16:00,120 --> 01:16:01,120
I'm surprised.

1351
01:16:01,120 --> 01:16:03,120
I don't think that I've ever heard you talk like that before.

1352
01:16:04,120 --> 01:16:05,120
Too harsh?

1353
01:16:05,120 --> 01:16:06,120
Not at all.

1354
01:16:06,120 --> 01:16:07,120
I'm glad.

